WEBVTT

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:12.490
<b><i>Yowamushi Pedal</i></b>

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:36.050
<i>LINE.24  The Small Pass</i>

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:39.530
<i>It must be him.</i>

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:43.950
<i>That's Hakone Academy's 
Mountain God, Toudou-san!</i>

00:01:44.710 --> 00:01:47.210
Well, if isn't four-eyes.

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:49.410
G-Good evening!

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:51.290
It's been a while!

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:53.460
<i>He's exuding so much pressure.</i>

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:55.380
<i>But he's so composed.</i>

00:01:55.780 --> 00:01:57.000
<i>He's so cool!</i>

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:02.470
Are you here to inspire Hakone Academy?

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:07.050
I was going to, but I got a call.

00:02:07.050 --> 00:02:10.580
Now I have to ride with this 
borrowed jersey and bike.

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:16.030
I'm chasing after a man riding up ahead.

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:18.520
I see.

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:21.490
Toudou-san, you haven't changed.

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:22.120
No, actually....

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:24.580
You've gotten faster at climbing.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:26.950
Your aura's grown even more impressive.

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:30.620
That's an honest impression, four-eyes.

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:32.650
That's exactly right!

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:39.470
I, the thrice-blessed Toudou Jinpachi,
have honed my speed and coolness even further!

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:42.690
<i>H-He really hasn't changed.</i>

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:45.060
I'm in college now.

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:49.230
Fuku, Shinkai, and Arakita 
are my opponents now.

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:50.710
<i>Opponents...</i>

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:54.650
But don't take me lightly, four-eyes.

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:58.150
They are my opponents only when we race.

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:00.700
In the mountains, they are no match for me.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:03.450
<i>H-He's so cool!</i>

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:09.250
It's too bad you didn't get to race 
against Manami in today's race.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:13.540
Oh, well... yes.

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:18.650
I was disappointed I didn't 
get to see you fight, too.

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:21.670
I was looking forward to it at the peak.

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:24.260
You were watching the race?

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:27.640
I wanted to see Manami get his revenge.

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:32.020
<i>He believes in Manami-kun.</i>

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:34.730
<i>That must be nice.</i>

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:38.360
Oh, right. I don't have time to chat.

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:41.740
You're in a hurry. Sorry for bothering you.

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:43.750
See you later, four-eyes!

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.590
Sorry for taking up your time.

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:48.370
Thank you... for...

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:50.040
<i>Huh?</i>

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:54.500
I'm chasing after a man riding up ahead.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:58.710
<i>Toudou-san's chasing someone?</i>

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.220
<i>That's odd.</i>

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.840
<i>He said no one stands a chance 
against him in the mountains.</i>

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:08.600
<i>But he's riding with that serious expression.</i>

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:11.180
<i>He's climbing in the middle of the night.</i>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.020
<i>Chasing someone.</i>

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:15.560
<i>Chasing who?</i>

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:17.820
<i>What is this?</i>

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:20.520
<i>My heart rate suddenly increased.</i>

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:22.740
<i>It's pounding so loudly.</i>

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:26.330
Wait for me, Toudou-san!

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:34.160
Four-eyes!

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:36.640
<i>He's fast!</i>

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:38.690
<i>He kept up with my acceleration on a climb!</i>

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:42.190
Are you sure, four-eyes? 
You've got a race tomorrow.

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:44.030
Should you be using up your energy here?

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:45.250
Tell me!

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:50.180
Who are you chasing right now, Toudou-san?

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:54.770
A willful man.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:58.550
He went to England alone 
without consulting anyone.

00:04:58.550 --> 00:05:00.550
I hadn't heard from him,

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:04.770
but then he suddenly called to say he'd 
be waiting for me on Mount Haruna.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.080
Funny, right?

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:12.290
After hearing that, I hastily jumped on 
a bike, and now I'm chasing after him.

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:15.830
I wanted to push myself to the limit again.

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:19.170
Who am I chasing?

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.340
You should see for yourself.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:25.180
After the turn up ahead, 
it's a long straightaway.

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:29.190
You'll see him illuminated 
by the streetlights then.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:32.920
His long limbs and hair 
waving back and forth...

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:35.180
Climbing with that unique form...

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:37.440
That spider-like man!

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:43.690
The glow of the streetlights 
and the sound of wheels...

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:47.320
How long are you going 
to make me wait, Toudou?

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:52.870
What's Sakamichi doing with you?

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:56.370
<i>My heart is pounding.</i>

00:05:56.950 --> 00:05:58.470
Makishima-san!

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:04.340
We're counting on you to 
carry our Sohoku, Sakamichi.

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:07.090
<i>My heart's going to burst.</i>

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:12.790
<i>Is what I'm seeing now an illusion?</i>

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:13.930
<i>Is it real?</i>

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:16.460
<i>You're right.</i>

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:18.890
<i>I could search the whole world over,</i>

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:22.650
<i>but you're the only one I'd 
find who rides with that form.</i>

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:24.530
Makishima-san!

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:33.910
<i>Toudou-san's Sleeping Climb!</i>

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.370
Sorry, four-eyes!

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:38.460
From here on out, it's a 
race between me and him!

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:39.790
I'm going on ahead!

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:41.210
O-Okay...

00:06:42.090 --> 00:06:43.490
<i>He's right.</i>

00:06:43.490 --> 00:06:47.030
<i>They're here because Makishima-san 
called Toudou-san.</i>

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:51.140
<i>I can't interfere.</i>

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:54.890
Toudou-san!

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:59.480
I-I hate to bother you but, um...

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:02.980
Could I keep riding with you?

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:06.440
This is our race.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:08.490
However...

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:13.200
Very well. History needs witnesses.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:17.480
You won't have time to blink, four-eyes!

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:18.080
Got it!

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:22.850
<i>Toudou-san and Makishima-san 
are neck and neck!</i>

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:23.460
<i>They're fast!</i>

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:25.530
Maki-chan...

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:28.150
Maki-chan!

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:33.510
<i>That's right. Toudou-san hasn't seen 
Makishima-san in a while, either.</i>

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:39.660
It's good to see you again, Maki-chan!

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:41.230
Yeah, Toudou!

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:46.950
Why don't you answer any calls or texts?

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:49.070
I'm too lazy.

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:51.220
Besides, what am I supposed to write back?

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:52.830
I can't think of anything to say.

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:54.660
"I'm doing well"?

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.430
"I miss you"?

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:58.340
Wouldn't that be creepy?

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:00.700
Your argument astonishes me.

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:04.420
But what about the 
sender's feelings, Maki-chan?

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:06.650
We're talking about four-eyes.

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:10.030
I'm sure he's sent you countless letters.

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:11.720
Mountains of letters!

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:18.550
That's why I'm here!

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:22.950
Are you disappointed, Toudou?

00:08:22.950 --> 00:08:26.100
No! I'm totally satisfied, Maki-chan!

00:08:30.370 --> 00:08:31.830
Maki-chan!

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:38.700
Maki-chan!

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:40.290
Toudou!

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.740
<i>This feeling, Jinpachi!</i>

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:46.080
<i>My heart is telling me to reach the peak!</i>

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:47.540
Let's go, Maki-chan!

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:49.620
Jinpachi!

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:54.870
That skill! That technique!

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:57.780
You haven't changed at all 
since a year ago, Maki-chan!

00:08:57.780 --> 00:09:00.600
Not that I care, but what's 
up with that jersey?

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.800
Talk about lame!

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:04.650
It's your fault for suddenly calling!

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:07.230
I had to borrow this bike and jersey!

00:09:08.050 --> 00:09:08.940
However...

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:11.840
I don't care if it's lame!

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:14.860
I get to battle you, Maki-chan!

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:19.780
How can you shout such 
embarrassing things, Jinpachi?

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:33.760
What's wrong, Jinpachi? Is that all?

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:35.690
Have your skills dulled in the past year?

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:36.890
No!

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:38.790
They've gotten sharper!

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:41.810
The turn's ending!

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:44.640
I won't let you take the peak, Maki-chan!

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.890
I'll stop you, Jinpachi!

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:48.790
<i>Amazing...</i>

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:51.400
<i>I could only describe this as amazing.</i>

00:09:51.850 --> 00:09:54.900
<i>My hands are shaking. My heart is on fire.</i>

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:57.200
<i>Neither one's giving any ground.</i>

00:09:58.130 --> 00:10:03.660
<i>It's not even a race, but they're fighting 
all out on this small, nameless pass.</i>

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:08.660
<i>Last year's Inter-High must 
have been this amazing.</i>

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:11.110
<i>I'm on fire.</i>

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:12.920
<i>What is this urge in my heart?</i>

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:18.090
<i>This situation should be tough for them.</i>

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:20.970
<i>But they're enjoying themselves!</i>

00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:25.770
<i>You can fight like this? 
You can ride like this?</i>

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:27.350
<b>100 Meters
to Lookout Point</b>

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:27.350
<i>I want to see more!</i>

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.350
<i>I want to see more, but...</i>

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:32.950
<i>We're already at the peak.</i>

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:35.610
<b>Downhill Ahead</b>

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:39.490
<i>We're entering the downhill.</i>

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:47.250
<i>It's over. I wanted to see more.</i>

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:53.060
U-Um, I don't know what to say.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:55.580
That race was amazing.

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:59.050
It really seemed like you finished 
at the same time, though.

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:00.280
Uh...

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:07.080
<i>They're right. It was too short.</i>

00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:14.110
<i>I'm glad I got to see their amazing race, 
but I'm sure their feelings run deeper.</i>

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:17.280
<i>They called it a race.</i>

00:11:29.850 --> 00:11:33.460
<i>But are they going to keep riding down?</i>

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:37.050
Did you hear what four-eyes said, Maki-chan?

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:39.860
Yeah. He said we tied.

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:42.700
He witnessed this race.

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:45.060
He said we tied.

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:46.200
That's not good.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:48.060
No, it's not.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:48.930
Huh?

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:50.810
It can't be helped.

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:53.510
Yeah, can't be helped.

00:11:53.510 --> 00:11:58.020
But it looked to me like you 
slowed your pedaling at the peak.

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:00.570
What are you talking about?

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:03.290
You're the one who slowed down, Maki-chan!

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:03.910
What?

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:04.990
No other choice, then!

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:05.490
In that case...

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:09.790
Time for round two!

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:13.710
<i>They turned around!</i>

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:18.130
<i>That's right. A downhill...</i>

00:12:22.870 --> 00:12:26.010
<i>Becomes an uphill if you make a U-turn!</i>

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:27.290
Let's go, Maki-chan!

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:29.220
Yeah, Jinpachi!

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:31.520
Round two!

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:34.020
This time let's go all out to the peak!

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:36.420
I've finished warming up!

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:37.650
Now I'm going all out!

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:40.090
Try not to fall behind, Jinpachi!

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:41.940
Who do you think you're 
talking to, Maki-chan?

00:12:42.890 --> 00:12:45.510
I-I'm not good at U-turns.

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:46.870
Hurry.

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:50.540
I need to catch up!

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:54.000
<i>They really are amazing.</i>

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:55.590
<i>I'm so happy.</i>

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:56.830
<i>I get to see them again.</i>

00:12:57.690 --> 00:13:00.590
<i>I get to watch them race!</i>

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.380
Round three!

00:13:04.690 --> 00:13:05.590
Round four!

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.370
Round five!

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:21.080
One more!

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.060
Last one!

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:28.960
<i>That day on that small pass, 
they climbed six times.</i>

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:30.930
<i>The first time they tied.</i>

00:13:30.930 --> 00:13:33.330
<i>On the second through 
fifth races, they won two each.</i>

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:37.370
<i>And the one who ultimately 
conquered the pass was...</i>

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.370
<b>100 Meters
to Lookout Point</b>

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:42.390
<i>Makishima-san.</i>

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:48.430
<i>Their race on that small 
pass won't be recorded.</i>

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:58.980
<i>But it left a huge mark on my heart.</i>

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:05.400
See? There they are again.

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.410
What? Where?

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:09.250
One, two...

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:10.660
There's a third one, too.

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:13.970
Two of them are moving really fast.

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:16.710
It's like the third one is chasing them.

00:14:17.030 --> 00:14:19.130
You think they're UFOs?

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:20.470
They are on top of the mountain.

00:14:20.470 --> 00:14:21.880
Well...

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:24.770
<i>This upperclassman of ours
can be kind of strange.</i>

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:25.840
No.

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:28.500
Those are bicycle headlights.

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:29.510
Huh?

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:32.350
You can see them through the trees.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:35.020
They're pretty fast.

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:39.020
Someone's racing.

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:42.060
It's probably a serious race.

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:43.890
Can you see them, Ishida?

00:14:43.890 --> 00:14:46.220
I see one that might be it.

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:48.120
Is that a bike, though?

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:50.040
He said he saw three.

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:51.720
Just how good are Manami-san's eyes?

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:52.700
Oh...

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:54.950
It's over.

00:14:57.590 --> 00:15:00.700
By the way, Manami-san, 
about tomorrow's schedule...

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:03.260
That's too bad.

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:06.560
I was going to go check 
it out if they kept going.

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:07.130
Right?

00:15:07.520 --> 00:15:09.020
<i>Check it out? Now?</i>

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:10.180
<i>On a bike?</i>

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.200
<i>"Right?"</i>

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.280
<i>He wanted us to go with him?</i>

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:14.650
<i>Manami-san's ideas are crazy!</i>

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:18.890
Come to think of it, Toudou-san 
was at the meeting earlier.

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:21.720
But he left in a hurry when it ended.

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:25.950
He asked to borrow a bike.

00:15:25.950 --> 00:15:29.100
The guy who lent him his bike is lucky.

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:30.400
Think something came up?

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:33.590
Like a friend was in the area?

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:38.550
In that case, I hope 
Toudou-san got to see him.

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:42.000
U-Um, excuse me.

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:45.100
I just got these at the 
bottom of the mountain.

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:46.670
You must be tired.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:49.880
These are for you.

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:56.100
Why are you standing so far away, four-eyes?

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:57.940
How are we supposed to get them?

00:15:57.940 --> 00:15:58.640
Right!

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:01.370
Um, you're just so awe-inspiring!

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:03.350
It's difficult to approach you.

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:07.230
After a battle like that,
I thought I'd be bothering you.

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:08.890
Um...

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:14.780
It's been so long since I've seen 
or talked to you, Makishima-san.

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:17.200
I'm nervous.

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:22.340
I'm not that big a deal.

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:25.330
I'm just your senior who came 
to Japan to watch the Inter-High

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:29.240
and happened to be wandering 
around a nameless pass.

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.050
You're Makishima-san.

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:37.080
<i>You're kind, reliable, and strong.</i>

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:39.640
<i>That's the Makishima-san I know.</i>

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:43.440
<i>I'm glad you haven't changed.</i>

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:46.570
You're idealizing me too much.

00:16:47.170 --> 00:16:48.680
You can call me scary.

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:56.660
While chasing behind you earlier, I kept
wishing to never wake up, if this were a dream.

00:16:57.490 --> 00:17:02.660
The situation was so incredible, 
I thought I must be dreaming.

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:04.750
Is it a dream or not?

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:09.750
Thank you for letting me ride with you!

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:19.610
Thanks, four-eyes.

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:25.350
They're cold.

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:28.560
Yes, sir!

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:30.500
Stop shouting.

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:41.050
Well, I'm heading back.

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:44.410
Kinjou and Tadokoro are waiting.

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:48.970
I forced Kinjou to lend me this.

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:54.800
See you later, Toudou.

00:17:55.650 --> 00:17:56.500
Yeah.

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:59.390
Um, I...

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:04.350
Thanks for the letters, Sakamichi.

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:13.190
Thanks for telling me about the club, 
the new members, and your practices.

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.480
I'm relieved to hear about them.

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:17.780
But...

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:22.470
You don't need to tell me about that 
anime character named Kumotaro.

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:23.960
Oh, really?

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:27.790
You seemed very interested in him 
when I gave you that present.

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:29.130
No, I wasn't.

00:18:31.050 --> 00:18:32.920
It's very like you to include that, though.

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:36.530
Are you uncertain, Sakamichi?

00:18:36.530 --> 00:18:37.420
Huh?

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:41.670
<b>We keep telling each other we'll do our best.

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:41.670
Your letter made it sound like you were
anxious about this year's Inter-High.

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:45.430
Being a second-year is hard.

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:47.240
Your seniors are giving you orders.

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:49.340
Your juniors are relying on you.

00:18:49.340 --> 00:18:51.940
You have to try harder 
than the previous year.

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:54.440
Everyone expects it.

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:57.690
It's not like being a first-year, 
who just has to listen to orders.

00:18:58.200 --> 00:18:59.910
You start to see your surroundings.

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:04.500
You restrict yourself by thinking 
you have to do things or be a certain way.

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:06.660
I know you.

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:11.330
Compared to last year, you must be more 
worried about how it's supposed to be.

00:19:12.470 --> 00:19:16.210
But don't worry about that stuff.

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:18.820
The fundamentals will always be the same.

00:19:19.240 --> 00:19:22.120
Your style is like your letters.

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:24.900
If you want to write 
about anime, write all about it.

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:26.810
Stick with it.

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:29.050
Anything goes with bicycles.

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:35.620
Nothing is cooler than seeing 
your style through to the end!

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:39.570
See you later, Sakamichi, Toudou.

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:41.200
Yes, sir.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.200
Yeah, Maki-chan.

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:47.530
Come to think of it,

00:19:47.530 --> 00:19:50.660
I should've told him I was watching 
this afternoon in the mountains.

00:19:52.760 --> 00:19:54.010
Whatever.

00:19:57.670 --> 00:20:00.590
Thank you, Makishima-san.

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:07.430
Tomorrow, on the last day, I'll ride all out!

00:20:10.070 --> 00:20:12.280
<i>I lit a fire inside four-eyes.</i>

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:15.930
<i>Maybe I shouldn't have let him ride with us.</i>

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:18.980
<i>No, that's not right.</i>

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:23.440
<i>You always want to fight your
 rival when he's in top condition.</i>

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:27.120
<i>No one wants an opponent 
who's uncertain or depressed.</i>

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:28.990
<i>The stronger, the better.</i>

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:32.010
<i>Isn't that right, Manami?</i>

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:35.210
Manami-san, where are you going?

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:38.660
To brush my teeth, I guess.

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:40.910
Can we join you?

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:43.540
What? I can do it myself.

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:45.950
<i>Kuroda-san told us to keep an eye on him.</i>

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:48.570
<i>He told us to send him to bed 
early because he's always late.</i>

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:50.820
<i>Toudou-san...</i>

00:20:52.050 --> 00:20:54.060
I'm a former member now.

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:56.220
I don't intend to give you any advice.

00:20:56.220 --> 00:21:01.060
What? Then why did you ask 
to see me before the meeting?

00:21:01.060 --> 00:21:05.960
I came to see if your eyes had 
grown dim, since you didn't get

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.530
to race against four-eyes today.

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:11.830
Oh, please. They're totally fine.

00:21:12.170 --> 00:21:17.540
If anything, I'm excited, now that 
it'll be happening on the last day.

00:21:18.070 --> 00:21:19.300
<i>That's a good look.</i>

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:23.060
<i>I doubt he'll have any problems.</i>

00:21:26.730 --> 00:21:28.440
Oh, no! The window...

00:21:28.440 --> 00:21:30.180
Manami-san escaped!

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:35.900
There's an even steeper 
mountain on the third day.

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:38.020
It's also the last day of the Inter-High.

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:39.190
In this situation...

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:41.810
How could I not be excited?

00:23:15.190 --> 00:23:18.440
M-Makishima-san, you haven't changed!

00:23:18.440 --> 00:23:19.290
You're still cool!

00:23:20.890 --> 00:23:21.500
And you're...

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:24.840
<i>...starting to look like a second-year.</i>

00:23:24.840 --> 00:23:28.260
Maki-chan, I'm a college student now!

00:23:30.450 --> 00:23:33.960
You've gotten kind of gaudier.

00:23:33.960 --> 00:23:35.960
Toudou-san, you're cool, too!

00:23:36.740 --> 00:23:39.890
<i>NEXT LINE  Their Respective Starting Lines</i>

00:23:36.920 --> 00:23:37.990
What?

00:23:37.990 --> 00:23:38.690
Huh?

00:23:39.890 --> 00:23:44.900
This is a work of fiction. All characters and organizations
 appearing in this work are fictional. In this work,
 characters sometimes engage in dangerous activities.
 While riding bicycles on actual roads,
 please follow all traffic laws and ride safely.

00:23:44.900 --> 00:23:50.250
<b>Don't miss the next episode</b>
